    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) Accidents can happen at home, on the road and in play.\nAt home do not touch fire, electric switches with wet hands or sharp things.\nOn the road walk on the footpath, cross at the zebra crossing and wear a helmet on a bike.\nWhile playing, follow rules and keep away from danger.\nTell a grown-up if you are not feeling safe."
